#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0649 expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "Pins the MACHINE-DERIVED guard: var_exists(ONTRTFL) folds FALSE on an absent column, so the rule EXECUTES and stays silent. That guard is DERIVED - it must never be written into the rule. PLAN-retire-corpus-transforms phase 4: the rule now declares the gate variable in Requirements.Variables.All, so the absent column takes the auditable SKIP this scenario pins (Fix #330 remedy: a presence rule reports the absence once)."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col ASEQ     type=Num
col AEDECOD  type=Char
col ONTR01FL type=Char
---
